Package: S7Examples
Title: S7 Examples in Bioconductor
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(person(given="Dario", family="Righelli", email="dario.righelli@gmail.com",
        role=c("aut", "cre")))
Mainteiner: Dario Righelli <dario.righelli@gmail.com>
Description: Describes how to create an S7 classe. It shows
    how to implement established Bioconductor methods from generics.
    Aimed for developers who want to re-use existing Bioconductor
    classes.
